<title>OMAN: Oman's United Power in maiden results.</title>
<headline>Oman's United Power in maiden results.</headline>
<dateline>MUSCAT 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>For the seven months to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(million Omani rials, rounded)</p>
<p> Net profit			  4.40</p>
<p> Pre-tax			     4.50</p>
<p> Operating profit		  3.32</p>
<p> Profit before exceptionals    1.42</p>
<p> Exceptional income		3.08</p>
<p>Full Name: United Power Co SAOG</p>
<p>Note: The company began partial generation of electricity at its Manah power plant at the end of May 1996. On October 15 full commercial operation began. Revenue earned and expenditure incurred between May 31 and October 15 have been treated as exceptional items.</p>
<p>The board recommended a cash dividend equal to 8.2 percent of share capital.</p>
<p>The company said it had submitted to the government a plan to expand capacity. A reponse is awaited.</p>
</text>
